  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseSyrenalianHCOccupationNPC">
    <defName>Syrnl_Council</defName>
    <label>councilor</label>
    <description>The Syrenalian occupation of councilor is the highest of the middle-ranked independent rulers.\n\nIn amongst Syrenalians, councillors control provinces, mega-cities, or moons. At war, a dominus can field a division-level force, or a fleet with capital ships and dozens of support craft.</description>
    <seniority>700</seniority>
    <commonality>1</commonality>
    <recruitmentResistanceOffset>125</recruitmentResistanceOffset>
  </RoyalTitleDef>

  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseSyrenalianHCOccupationNPC">
    <defName>Syrnl_Council_High</defName>
    <label>high councilor</label>
    <description>The Syrenalian occupation of high councilor is a lower level of high nobility.\n\nIn amongst Syrenalians, high councillors control planets. At war, a consul can usually field an army-sized force of multiple divisions, supported by several fleets. Some command from a super-capital ship or control space-based megastructures.</description>
    <seniority>800</seniority>
    <commonality>0.6</commonality>
    <recruitmentResistanceOffset>150</recruitmentResistanceOffset>
  </RoyalTitleDef>

  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseSyrenalianHCOccupationNPC">
    <defName>Syrnl_Monarch</defName>
    <label>monarch</label>
    <labelFemale>queen</labelFemale>
    <description>The Syrenalian occupation of monarch represents dominion over an entire region.\n\nIn amongst Syrenalians, since interstellar travel times are years long, monarchs rule their regions with a great degree of independence. They each swear fealty to the High Queen, but since the High Queen may be many light-years away, a monarch may go years or decades without interacting with her.</description>
    <seniority>900</seniority>
    <commonality>0.2</commonality>
    <recruitmentResistanceOffset>200</recruitmentResistanceOffset>
    <replaceOnRecruited>Consul</replaceOnRecruited>
    <requiredApparel>
      <li>
        <bodyPartGroupsMatchAny>
          <li>UpperHead</li>
          <li>FullHead</li>
        </bodyPartGroupsMatchAny>
        <requiredTags>
          <li>RoyalTier7</li>
        </requiredTags>
        <allowedTags>
          <li>PrestigeCombatGear</li>
          <li>Psychic</li>
          <li>Mechlord</li>
        </allowedTags>
      </li>
    </requiredApparel>
  </RoyalTitleDef>

  <RoyalTitleDef ParentName="BaseSyrenalianHCOccupationNPC">
    <defName>Syrnl_Monarch_High</defName>
    <label>high monarch</label>
    <labelFemale>high queen</labelFemale>
    <description>The Syrenalian occupation of high monarch indicates sovereign dominion over a entire Syrenalian planet, all its peoples, ships, and fleets. All other monarchs swear fealty to a high monarch, while the High Monarch swears fealty to no one. However, even the High Monarch depends on the support of lower nobles to remain in power.</description>
    <seniority>1000</seniority>
    <commonality>0.1</commonality>
    <requiredApparel>
      <li>
        <bodyPartGroupsMatchAny>
          <li>UpperHead</li>
          <li>FullHead</li>
        </bodyPartGroupsMatchAny>
